{"id":"n73844-1-8","stage":5,"title":"자수 · 自首","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73844-1-8-1","ko":"차로 사람을 쳤는데, 너무 무서워서 나도 모르게 도망쳤어.","zh":"我开车撞到人了，当时太害怕了，不知不觉就逃走了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"차로","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람을","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쳤는데,","meaning":"撞，轧","explanation":"치다：撞，轧；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79272","senseId":"1","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무서워서","meaning":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","explanation":"무섭다：怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"1","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르게","meaning":"不知不觉","explanation":"모르다：不知不觉；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"8","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도망쳤어.","meaning":"逃跑，逃亡","explanation":"도망치다：逃跑，逃亡；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"도망치다","audio":"/audio/eba9ed68509b1aadd864.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14392","senseId":"1","lemma":"도망치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"撞，轧","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"79272","definition":"汽车等剧烈碰撞到人后直接开过去。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"忌讳某个对象或担心出什么事。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知不觉","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"在无意中不自觉地做出某种行为或说出某种话。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"eba9ed68509b1aad","term":"도망치다","zh":"逃跑，逃亡","audio":"/audio/eba9ed68509b1aadd864.mp3","entryId":"14392","definition":"为躲避或被追赶而逃走。","pronunciation":["도망치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/74d7750ead039262d6d5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73844-1-8-2","ko":"뭐라고? 당장 자수를 하는 게 좋겠다.","zh":"什么？你最好马上去投案自首。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭐라고?","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당장","meaning":"立刻，马上","explanation":"당장：立刻，马上","readings":[{"term":"당장","audio":"/audio/628e6056279caca7c26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61387","senseId":"3","lemma":"당장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자수를","meaning":"自首","explanation":"자수：自首；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자수","audio":"/audio/7d3a06330bed335dfab7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73844","senseId":"1","lemma":"자수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋겠다.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"628e6056279caca7","term":"당장","zh":"立刻，马上","audio":"/audio/628e6056279caca7c26e.mp3","entryId":"61387","definition":"在事情发生的场所中立即。","pronunciation":["당장"]},{"id":"7d3a06330bed335d","term":"자수","zh":"自首","audio":"/audio/7d3a06330bed335dfab7.mp3","entryId":"73844","definition":"犯人自己主动到调查机关告知自己的罪行并要求处罚。","pronunciation":["자수"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5d8491333493626c83f1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.394,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73844","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2207,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["什么？你最好马上去投案自首。","今天这米饭格外好吃。","我开车撞到人了，当时太害怕了，不知不觉就逃走了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["什么？你最好马上去投案自首。","我开车撞到人了，当时太害怕了，不知不觉就逃走了。","今天这米饭格外好吃。"],"answer":0}]}
